{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many ordered triples of integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d9e22097e20a1249b5332202b24941a4bf9e1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b447731aa5c8c5b6b41ee79c5c2d90cbe1ce8ea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a+b|+c = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b3080d7c4597c0037184a239dd93674d8b9e716f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+|c| = 97$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0d560d13e07a3462e962f6dea20d8290418a64e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=WLOG\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"WLOG\">WLOG</a>, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c632dfe2dd9c8e9b2f677981b55d68f8e12610.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/7/18786649350a0a7e257fb57a375eb1093d51a225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.  We can say this because if we have one solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/d/1bd87cfdbd685adf564f60c7bdad3f5fc048c743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b) = (a_0, b_0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/7/da7e38c370a97494ee31b888397929aaa9cc10f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0 \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05b04ff8bf5df396cab1b544b7526c34bcfaba22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0 &gt; b_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, we really have the four solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/08406691a9a5ac03ec1510c829373cb803fe7346.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_0, b_0), (-a_0, -b_0), (b_0, a_0), (-b_0, -a_0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"297\" height=\"18\" /> by the symmetry of the original problem.  \n</p><p>Furthermore, we assert that these four solutions are distinct.  We can say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/d/25d8ed1fc54739081e1cc984b300a5b1bd0a984f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, since if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abd2c942ae299fd26e18d0ca5d390a7ca4a8c34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/8/d3803245688da36be0625c2d7246a76397675cc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 19 - 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> for the first equation and either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/b/a6b0ee34653360a703c2dc9d551dec85a25e9fe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 97 - a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/7/f472452687fc17ba532791006b24dd357f956e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a^2 - 97$\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" /> for the second equation.  Equating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/4/774e826812a1f4ac13fc6c67caab7f7267c77f04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19 - 2a = 97 - a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" /> gives no integer solution, while equating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea75a7c249e3048539e4b846a43d72caa8f9a62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19 - 2a = a^2 - 97$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"140\" height=\"15\" /> also gives no integer solution.\n</p><p>Thus, we can now assume WLOG that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c632dfe2dd9c8e9b2f677981b55d68f8e12610.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/d/25d8ed1fc54739081e1cc984b300a5b1bd0a984f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, and each pair of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/f/b0f7fb3a044f364b5e8233d3fcbf0c9ab534861a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_0,b_0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> that we get will generate four unique solutions:  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/9/5b9e48cd99be04ecbf75897c268da6c001bfab9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_0, b_0), (b_0, a_0), (-a_0, -b_0), (-b_0, -a_0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"297\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nWe now divide the problem into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/6/e566834db376ac33941a38556b9eaa9c03580d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/d/b3dd417591a694e2339db5d9c3666343ee396e70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/6/e566834db376ac33941a38556b9eaa9c03580d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03eb82a17ac1a3d13baba165f8dcbba203d82db0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| + c = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/a/4da342b73277656c6f589b34357c41752c73c7b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + c = 97$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Solving both equations for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and equating them, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/6/e360fc7d23bad488e14936d38145d2e20f3c2b57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab - |a + b| = 78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />.  Splitting these up, we find that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/cca90c1b0c3b7d9e2f4c20b1da2213149de8dc92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab - a - b = 78$\" width=\"121\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f04b1999f833bcb771211fae183a0b71b2e8377c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + a+ b = 78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"121\" height=\"14\" />.  Factoring both with <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=SFFT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SFFT\">SFFT</a> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/9/eb9f9efbc384e644320af8c797d215d235aad692.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-1)(b-1) = 79$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eaf7037fd3cd9546f49b61eacbc7df9a9529f13f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a +1)(b+1) = 79$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" />.  We factor with the restrctions that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c632dfe2dd9c8e9b2f677981b55d68f8e12610.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/d/25d8ed1fc54739081e1cc984b300a5b1bd0a984f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/8/cd8b908d15627ea3a118bb38668d865edf722170.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$79$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is prime, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/64852cb02f5f0a53ddc21c6c38267ee6f1e7a690.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - 1 = 79$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2ab54fdced633985f9699fd835d04cee670e09bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b - 1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />, which leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7be10037e80ccf994adec0ea988d297ce1c03d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(80,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/5/cd5b2536d26ca6552e9b01c49cd5dabcb5940536.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 1 = 79$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/7/dc7d740225194875853caa484eb355afb91c5211.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" />, which leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/9/3f923366330a44a72e0e14432cb634d7893185ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(78, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Each of those solutions could generate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more solutions, giving a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> potential solutions.  However, in each the first set of four solutions, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9875306ac4d0ade48a245c040551a4b2850aee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| = 82$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"94\" height=\"20\" />, which from the original first equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03eb82a17ac1a3d13baba165f8dcbba203d82db0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| + c = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/0/0208122770bc807a8c546329142fad4838b810e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 19 - 82$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />, which contradicts our initial assumption that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/d/65d237dfff62b869608f516a9450c781875aef25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />.  Similarly, for the second set of four solutions, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57b226c2114dd51884da4bf162491902fdd73205.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| = 78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />, which leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/6/466cf35394768d089021e24b5c697a087c8cfb6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 19 - 78$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />, also contradicting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/6/e566834db376ac33941a38556b9eaa9c03580d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/d/b3dd417591a694e2339db5d9c3666343ee396e70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03eb82a17ac1a3d13baba165f8dcbba203d82db0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| + c = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/6599d7924585cdd6aae5535880cce1706c6f2752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab - c = 97$\" width=\"89\" height=\"12\" />.  We note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/d/04ddde7fdbaa3b539f5b589fe35cf63d6e8edb5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19 - c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" /> must be positive whenever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is negative, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e0f2cc67196572affbe139af6050bb77b12b3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| = a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Solving both equations for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and using SFFT as above gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd919e6e34a05a8c77f6c07f6fb3c6f4e137fc95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+1)(b+1) = 117$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"18\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e7587a1267b8cf24d510865b2c2f9195a9268f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$117 = 3^2\\cdot 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />, we factor with the restriction that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/0/240eeb412e76d473cf63e1da779b0aa0e434187f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/d/25d8ed1fc54739081e1cc984b300a5b1bd0a984f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.  Thus, we can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/5/cc52aebb29fe9bbe187c6b9872aec9b5f824a87a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+1  \\in \\{117, 39, 13\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"18\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c8581c8ee4aee348547738a3d115d7842690d57d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in \\{116, 38, 12\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" />.  These give corresponding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/387fcb3c9ab51592877b1fadeef152e91755e08a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+1\\in \\{1, 3, 9\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />, which leads to corresponding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/387d22d8e92ce8cfd7a39044b6ce19c3a275875d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\in \\{0, 2, 8\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />.  Combining the solutions, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaa1b444d5a371f04ac09a44af654717d574f0b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b) = (116, 0), (38, 2), (12, 8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"236\" height=\"18\" />.  \n</p><p>Each of these three solutions permutes, negates, and permute-negates into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions as described in the start of the solution, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> solutions.\n</p><p>Checking our solutions to ensure <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/d/b3dd417591a694e2339db5d9c3666343ee396e70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, we find in the first set of four solutions, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/5/415eb206a3458f6d2a5bfb918f8682226f58d83f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| = 116$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/d/98d5bbd178cb2f12a27ab3ccbb76a3b6f1523df7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 19 - 116$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"99\" height=\"13\" />, which is indeed negative.\n</p><p>In the second set of four solutions, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/6/3965b0097d453bb50f0717024ade765772e6252a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />, which leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/b/b3b10a6fce267992394a73e4a066413075b847e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 19 - 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />, which is also negative.\n</p><p>Finally, in the third set of four solutoins, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/4783d738860dc0101a8e9f5b9f69924aebc6d9ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a + b| = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />, which leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/89748ddc79505d4b6e47bc34165a8551e9c069d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 19 - 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />, which is negative.\n</p><p>Thus, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> ordered triples, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>